    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb47cebc737ca4d7003a364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员！自主训练结束了！\\n我非常努力哦，请您务必来看看成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a20e0253cf1498a545220d154ab3f66f7867055cdea8a71acc21310666137e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb533add25379089f581c5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。……在训练员\\n到来之前，我会边跑边等您的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d690b26ef6b154f16eff8784dcab025056baec8aaec6482af2415ccf04e17a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24d7fe50a6c425cabf91efa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂——训练员！自主训练结束了哦！\\n再不快点来的话，我可就去找会长了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6311e2b4a4fa26954f9799c67bfb79771a7197079bc9a7f4e4832a49e6c215b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1728328916b9f87f947d9d92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕。状态超级棒哦♪\\n姐姐我时髦又青春的跑姿，不来看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ad9f5c51801d1ee0afc593591bfaec7f540a5ea2fc1028645c2a763cdf6f3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d645e2cf5ae561965dd094ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除了自主训练的成果，我还得准备\\n特别的惊喜才行呢。那么，做好大吃一惊的准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a4d039addf7cd86f7f0629a7cef28243012ce28fe257f27daf1f9945d727b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf23c29623e03a9bd2c8cbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。关于训练内容我有些事想找你\\n商量……不过在此之前，我想先和你一起吃个饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f395423ec39f9862cea189b11e5916cc5277e9382ea60b61ec5facc8ed31194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69392ecc7385661db9525eb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来一决胜负吧。是你先夸奖我的自主训练呢，\\n还是我先用青口贝色把整个学园涂满呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a507968189706685829b015437ece7edef3e7f52342100efda229acb1c1fb3c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93384f420b4bc3ce84c38e64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼——，大功告成了……我构思的最强自主训练！\\n来吧搭档！看着这惊人的成果大吃一惊吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e081f6be2dca6f71ef0c36f967c81217d021d81826b434055927d5200d64983e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb524a78fc9d713df8f752",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的，等你的时候我都把自主训练做完了哦？\\n要是再让我等下去，我可饶不了你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b468f6d23403c7e5c5c33437b788a30662f7ba353381deafce083689f4e69b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d02bf72401f37095f1c771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练是结束了……但拥抱不够啊！\\n呜……训练员，请快点回来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fe95ef03447a9b7108849314afe2455f1aaa3f74c4fe1d2b530d1e2036ea98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2958c5d558c34509b18d33c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练我已经做完啦～。\\n这是我潜心打磨出的成果……请您拭目以待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f011ba290b8a89133228215e359e45c73608410b4c4416b58a4d67e5de010577",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cddbe8b58ff73d189cb937c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！好啦，接下来轮到你了。\\n你准备好适合我现在实力的菜单了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce2489e0e17aee2f65c42dbed5808375be9a72dd2b0653668f982386097d26c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ca7cd5776cb3f6df87d394",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练也做完了，我打算品尝您给的低糖甜点……\\n顺便向您汇报成果，要一起喝杯茶吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5132231752f962e0b93e106f55f7bc8f2bc86991bda6d66e22269f440d49369",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6967697b1c8e7f4bf3a2b044",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练也～……完毕！成长！大爆走——！\\n神鹰已经变得最强了，就在您的眼前尽情展示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b54fd8b3f75b9608b0a98f6b812a8f2575d2124a10a4612a2e5c2ad4846571e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd706b0076eeb05256bbee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你竟然错过了我努力进行自主训练的美丽身姿……？\\n无需忧虑，来看看我现在如花般绽放的模样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a948ed7c0cf1575a1ac5dce90d10993d13c9357f1de093d66f8ecda9f796a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8edfa049e36e4017ef4630b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通过自主训练，我的獠牙已打磨锋利。\\n那么，猎场在哪里？——别让我等太久了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0d3a4bf7f86c7a68a2e35a89acf32bb69d7224ccdbceac7d0e96003891a341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea5621e7be4510888935f44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "专心致志……自主训练已经结束了。\\n关于结果我也想听听你的意见，你意下如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b040b05a4fd9d8a37d220c3c6b130cb30534afd99ad4f1a62ea10922680c408",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7720d8f3268339d167ffb734",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练已经结束了。接下来的指示还没好吗？\\n这是你的工作，给我完美地完成它。……你能做到的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16c2af0ace91190f5cfa2dd9a8dcd20c59f4c82ce64642a29c01ea3ea8a30cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf81327cfc36cdc93dc20df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在推们包围下的自主训练，进展非常顺利……！\\n接下来要不要聊聊推……不对，共享一下情报？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf770a0728318acf34ae2ba9e5062ea70c02672c19b290ca55a6a4f1c363707",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a085ecf8e36db4508203dec1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个星云酱，竟然做完了自主训练……！\\n这份疲惫，光靠我自己可是没法治愈的啊～……（偷瞄）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea915db9cbe1e07f9b12f5364257a48c66fb72dc2cef9af5d9b6eac8b339ecbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311f290b19cc2ed1ec369a11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好耶！自主训练做完啦！不过还是直接\\n让你来指导更能让人燃起来啊。快点来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d74bb3790a5606206475d80ecdd4d691896af69bafc48a5f9b935e8175f2de4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2842f9f4cecd5a80726a4b78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束！因为努力过了，今天的拉面\\n肯定格外美味吧。呵呵，要一起去吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6412fb2355f7878f14605eb527380845d98a654265a0ae519d447a92a4c3223",
